t to\'e1n thu chi t\'e0i ch\'ednh chung c\u7911\'3f}{\f87\insrsid9660078\charrsid9660078 a \'f0\'f5n v}{\f0\insrsid9660078\charrsid9660078 \u7883\'3f.
